title: YARN-10320.Replace FSDataInputStream#read with readFully in Log Aggregation
category: other
requirement: '## Context

  Indexed YARN aggregated-log readers currently rely on single `read` calls for fixed-size metadata segments, which can silently accept partial data and then misinterpret checksums or UUID-related fields.


  ## Desired outcome

  Index parsing should fully read each fixed-size metadata segment before decoding it so short reads cannot masquerade as complete data.


  ## Acceptance signals

  Aggregated-log metadata is interpreted only after the full expected byte ranges have been loaded, and partial stream reads no longer produce corrupted or misleading index parsing.

  '
